## Hints for Future Agents
Runtime metadata is excluded from MDC checksum equality, so validate optional contracts against admitted membership separately. Pending or closed watches must withhold observation and queries. try_lock in the pending callback avoids lock inversion. Preserve identity quarantine and sequence across residency invalidation. Require every exported parallel prefix and keep CPU and disk medium bits independent. Sequence gaps clear residency before accepting a batch. Stale generations must neither clear successor state nor advance its cursor. Shared hits are one logical proven prefix, not physical object counts or cached-token credits.

